# Railway deploy (education / rag-bot)

After committing education-bot / Zalo OA / weekly-exam / care-symbol / specialty SOP changes in this repo:

1. `git push origin HEAD` (if not already pushed)
2. Deploy production: `railway up --detach` (linked service `washfriends-rag-bot`)
3. Confirm with `railway deployment list --limit 3` — wait until newest is `SUCCESS`
4. Smoke-check if useful: `POST /ask` with a short Korean phrase (e.g. care-symbol show)

Do **not** leave features only on GitHub. Zalo OA hits Railway; unpushed or undeployed commits will not appear to owners.

Surface: education / rag only — do not touch washfriends-backend orders or frontend hosting from this repo’s deploy step.
